<h1>Leaderboard entry files</h1>
<p class="lede">One JSON per board entry — the exact files the leaderboard renders, CI bounds included. Regenerate from the aggregate with <code>cli/seed_entries.py</code> (null control: <code>cli/run_null_baseline.py</code>); recheck any entry's score block with <code>cli/verify.py --entry</code>. Source of truth in the repo's <a href="https://github.com/owl-fleet/labyrinthbench/tree/main/entries">entries/</a>.</p>
